{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sound Designer","role":"Sound Designer","summary":"A Sound Designer creates, records, edits, layers, mixes, and shapes sound for films, web series, documentaries, advertisements, games, animation, OTT content, and immersive media. The role combines audio technology, storytelling, music awareness, acoustics, recording, post-production, and creative direction.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Film & Video Communication"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Film & Video Communication student can build a career across:"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film & OTT"},{"text":"Sound Designer, Sound Editor, Re-recording Mixer"}],[{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Production Sound Mixer, Location Sound Recordist"}],[{"text":"Post-production"},{"text":"Dialogue Editor, Foley Editor, Audio Post Producer"}],[{"text":"Music & Audio"},{"text":"Music Editor, Audio Editor, Sound Effects Editor"}],[{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Commercial Sound Designer, Audio Post Specialist"}],[{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Animation Sound Designer, Foley Artist"}],[{"text":"Games"},{"text":"Game Audio Designer, Interactive Audio Designer"}],[{"text":"Theatre"},{"text":"Theatre Sound Designer"}],[{"text":"Immersive Media"},{"text":"Spatial Audio Designer, XR Audio Designer"}],[{"text":"Broadcast"},{"text":"Broadcast Audio Engineer"}],[{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Podcast Producer, Audio Editor"}],[{"text":"Freelancing"},{"text":"Independent Sound Designer / Audio Post-Production Specialist"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Audio & Film Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamental knowledge of both filmmaking and sound."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fundamentals of sound"},{"text":"Frequency, amplitude, wavelength and decibels"},{"text":"Analog vs digital audio"},{"text":"Sample rate and bit depth"},{"text":"Mono, stereo and surround sound"},{"text":"Microphone fundamentals"},{"text":"Audio signal flow"},{"text":"Basic acoustics"},{"text":"Film grammar"},{"text":"Storytelling and visual language"},{"text":"Introduction to editing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Audition"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve Fairlight"},{"text":"Reaper"},{"text":"Audacity for basic experimentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Record environmental sounds around campus"},{"text":"Create a 60-second soundscape"},{"text":"Rebuild sound for a short silent video"},{"text":"Record dialogue using different microphones"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Recording & Sound Editing"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from theory to production-level audio work."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Location sound recording"},{"text":"Boom operation"},{"text":"Lavalier microphones"},{"text":"Shotgun microphones"},{"text":"Dialogue recording"},{"text":"Noise reduction"},{"text":"Dialogue editing"},{"text":"Sound effects editing"},{"text":"Foley recording"},{"text":"Room tone"},{"text":"ADR fundamentals"},{"text":"Audio synchronization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gain staging"},{"text":"EQ"},{"text":"Compression"},{"text":"Limiting"},{"text":"Reverb"},{"text":"Delay"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Noise gates"},{"text":"De-essing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Major project:"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a 5–10 minute short film and create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Original video","dialogue edit","Foley","ambience","sound effects","transitions","music","final mix"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Sound Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop specialization and professional workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative sound design"},{"text":"Cinematic sound effects"},{"text":"Foley design"},{"text":"Atmospheres"},{"text":"Sound symbolism"},{"text":"Emotional sound design"},{"text":"Advanced dialogue editing"},{"text":"ADR workflow"},{"text":"Multitrack mixing"},{"text":"5.1 surround fundamentals"},{"text":"Loudness standards"},{"text":"Audio delivery specifications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pro Tools"},{"text":"Reaper"},{"text":"Nuendo"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve Fairlight"},{"text":"iZotope RX"},{"text":"Soundly"},{"text":"Kontakt or similar sampler platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target:"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce 3–5 polished sound redesign projects rather than dozens of basic edits."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Industry Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a professional direction."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Sound Design"},{"text":"Dialogue Editing"},{"text":"Foley"},{"text":"Location Sound"},{"text":"Re-recording Mixing"},{"text":"Game Audio"},{"text":"Animation Sound"},{"text":"Advertising Audio"},{"text":"Spatial / Immersive Audio"},{"text":"Podcast & Digital Audio Production"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Work on a final-year film or major production where you handle the complete sound workflow."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key Skills","Typical Tools"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film Sound Designer"},{"text":"Sound storytelling, effects, ambience"},{"text":"Pro Tools, Reaper"}],[{"text":"Dialogue Editor"},{"text":"Cleanup, ADR, synchronization"},{"text":"Pro Tools, RX"}],[{"text":"Foley Artist"},{"text":"Physical sound creation"},{"text":"Pro Tools, RX"}],[{"text":"Location Sound"},{"text":"Recording on set"},{"text":"Field recorder, boom"}],[{"text":"Re-recording Mixer"},{"text":"Final dialogue/music/effects mix"},{"text":"Pro Tools, Nuendo"}],[{"text":"Game Audio"},{"text":"Interactive audio, middleware"},{"text":"FMOD, Wwise, Unreal"}],[{"text":"Animation Audio"},{"text":"Foley, effects, timing"},{"text":"Pro Tools, Reaper"}],[{"text":"Spatial Audio"},{"text":"Immersive sound fields"},{"text":"Dolby Atmos tools"}],[{"text":"Advertising Audio"},{"text":"Fast commercial post-production"},{"text":"Audition, Pro Tools"}],[{"text":"Podcast Producer"},{"text":"Editing, mixing, storytelling"},{"text":"Audition, Reaper"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film production internships"},{"text":"Video editing internships"},{"text":"Podcast internships"},{"text":"YouTube production teams"},{"text":"College media teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audio post-production studios"},{"text":"Film studios"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"Production houses"},{"text":"OTT content teams"},{"text":"Documentary production companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional sound studios"},{"text":"Feature-film post-production"},{"text":"OTT production"},{"text":"Game studios"},{"text":"Animation studios"},{"text":"Audio post-production companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best internship role titles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sound Design Intern"},{"text":"Audio Post-Production Intern"},{"text":"Sound Editing Intern"},{"text":"Assistant Sound Designer"},{"text":"Audio Engineer Intern"},{"text":"Foley Intern"},{"text":"Production Sound Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a Complete Short-Film Audio Post-Production Project."},{"type":"h","text":"Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Picture Lock","Dialogue Editing","Noise Cleanup","ADR where required","Foley","Sound Effects","Background Ambience","Music","Mixing","Mastering / Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the project with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Before/after dialogue"},{"text":"Raw vs processed audio"},{"text":"Foley recording"},{"text":"Sound-effects layers"},{"text":"Final mix"},{"text":"Technical specifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes a strong portfolio case study."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas of learning include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pro Tools certification/training"},{"text":"Avid audio-production training"},{"text":"Adobe Audition"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve Fairlight"},{"text":"Reaper"},{"text":"Dolby audio fundamentals"},{"text":"Wwise"},{"text":"FMOD"},{"text":"iZotope RX"},{"text":"Game audio production"},{"text":"Sound recording"},{"text":"Film sound post-production"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are useful, but portfolio quality and practical audio work generally matter more for creative sound roles."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After graduation, possible job titles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Sound Designer"},{"text":"Sound Designer"},{"text":"Sound Editor"},{"text":"Audio Editor"},{"text":"Dialogue Editor"},{"text":"Foley Artist"},{"text":"Assistant Sound Designer"},{"text":"Audio Post-Production Assistant"},{"text":"Production Sound Assistant"},{"text":"Sound Effects Editor"},{"text":"Audio Engineer"},{"text":"Podcast Audio Editor"},{"text":"Game Audio Designer"},{"text":"Junior Re-recording Mixer"},{"text":"Music Editor"},{"text":"Audio Post Producer"}]}]},{"heading":"Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Technical Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Be prepared to explain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is sample rate?"},{"text":"What is bit depth?"},{"text":"What is gain staging?"},{"text":"Difference between EQ and compression"},{"text":"What is dynamic range?"},{"text":"What is a noise gate?"},{"text":"What is ADR?"},{"text":"What is Foley?"},{"text":"What is room tone?"},{"text":"How do you remove background noise?"},{"text":"Difference between mono and stereo"},{"text":"What is loudness?"},{"text":"What is clipping?"},{"text":"What is phase cancellation?"},{"text":"How do you synchronize audio and video?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Test"},{"type":"p","text":"You may be given:"},{"type":"p","text":"A short video with poor or missing audio."},{"type":"p","text":"You could be asked to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clean dialogue"},{"text":"Add ambience"},{"text":"Create Foley"},{"text":"Add sound effects"},{"text":"Synchronize audio"},{"text":"Mix the tracks"},{"text":"Export the final version"}]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Structure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional portfolio should demonstrate storytelling through sound, not simply software knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Silent Film Redesign"},{"type":"p","text":"Add the complete soundscape to a dialogue-free scene."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Dialogue Cleanup"},{"type":"p","text":"Show:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw dialogue","cleaned dialogue","final mix"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Foley"},{"type":"p","text":"Create sounds for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Footsteps"},{"text":"Doors"},{"text":"Clothing"},{"text":"Objects"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Physical actions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Cinematic Sound Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dramatic sequence with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Atmosphere"},{"text":"Impacts"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Tension"},{"text":"Environmental sounds"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Documentary"},{"type":"p","text":"Design realistic environmental sound and dialogue."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Game Audio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create interactive sounds for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UI"},{"text":"Weapons"},{"text":"Movement"}