 sound design","mixing","specialization"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 3"},{"type":"flow","items":["Major film project","internship","professional showreel"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 4"},{"type":"note","label":"Graduation","text":"Junior Sound Designer / Sound Editor / Audio Post-Production Specialist"},{"type":"note","label":"3–5 Years","text":"Independent Sound Designer / Senior Sound Editor / Game Audio Designer"},{"type":"note","label":"5–10 Years","text":"Supervising Sound Designer / Audio Director / Re-recording Mixer"}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A highly employable B.Des Film & Video Communication graduate targeting Sound Designer should graduate with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong understanding of film language"},{"text":"Professional audio-recording knowledge"},{"text":"Pro Tools/Reaper proficiency"},{"text":"DaVinci Fairlight knowledge"},{"text":"iZotope RX experience"},{"text":"Dialogue-editing skills"},{"text":"Foley experience"},{"text":"Sound-effects library"},{"text":"At least 5–8 polished audio projects"},{"text":"One complete short-film sound redesign"},{"text":"One game/interactive audio project"},{"text":"Professional showreel"},{"text":"Internship/post-production experience"},{"text":"Understanding of mixing and delivery standards"},{"text":"Basic spatial-audio knowledge"},{"text":"AI-assisted audio workflow awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal final skill stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Film & Video Communication","Sound Recording","Dialogue Editing","Foley","Sound Design","Mixing","Pro Tools","Reaper","RX","Spatial Audio","Wwise/FMOD","Unreal Engine","AI Audio Tools","Professional Showreel"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination provides a strong foundation for careers across film, OTT, advertising, animation, games, podcasts, immersive media and emerging AI-driven audio production."}]}]}